        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olkilikuai lo Laitoriani too Siraeli ootii Misiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ele rorei oewuo enetii Yeremia eipirta lelo Yahudi pooki apa oomanya enkop e Misiri, te Migdol, te Tafahes, te Memfis, o tiatua enkop e Patros ejo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, Enkai e Israel: Itoduaa intae ina torroni pooki nayaua nanu shumata Yerusalem o shumata nkanas pooki e Yuda. Ng'ura, ore ena olong olmuaate ninche, nemetii hoo ng'ae omanya atua ninche, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enkaraki ina torroni nataasa ninche, naaitagor nanu, teina nashomo ninche aapej enkorropil neisiaai kulie aitin apa neitu eyiolou ninche, ninche aashu o intae aashu loo papaai linyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake eyia aitirrishaka nanu airriwaki intae isinkan laainei pooki lelo oibonok le Nkai, ajo, ‘Ee, miaas ena taboi naiba nanu!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eitu ninche ening aashu eishoru enkiok enye, pee eibelekenya aaing'uaa entorroni enye nemeitoki aapejoki enkorropil kulie aitin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku ore emion o engoro ai napi netubukuoki neyupuyupieki tiatua nkanas e Yuda o tiatua nkoitoi e Yerusalem; neaku ninche mijoonito o lmuaateni, anaa enatiu tena olong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata nji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai oo lororani, Enkai e Israel: Kainyoo intae pee iasiasa ena torroni sapuk tialo intae maate, aadung'oo aaiwuangie tiatua intae olee o enkitok, elooyo o enkerai, aaitung'uaa empolos e Yuda, nemeing'uiekini intae olpisiai? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kainyoo pee kintagorigoro nanu te siaai oo nkaik inyi, ipejokiki enkorropil kulie aitin tiatua enkop e Misiri teine apa nietuo aatonie, pee etumi aaiwuang'ie intae niakuku oldeket o enkurruna tiatua iloreren pooki le nkop? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ketorikine intae esuujisho oo loo papaai linyi, entorroni o laiguanani le Yuda, o entorroni oo kituaak enye, o entorroni inyi maate, o entorroni oo nkituaak inyi apa nataasa ninche tiatua enkope Yuda o too nkoitoi naalala e Yerusalem? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eitu ninche eitobor ate ometabaiki ninye ena olong, aashu eureishoyu, aashu epuo te nkitanapata ai o nkiguanat aainei apa natipika dukuya intae o dukuya loo papaai linyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore naa nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, Enkai e Israel: Ng'ura kaing'orie nanu enkomom ai intae te ntorroni, pee aiwuang'ie Yuda pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaya nanu ilo pisiai le Yuda ooibelekenya inkomomi enye pee epuonu enkop e Misiri aatonie naa keidaikieki ninche pooki; tiatua enkop e Misiri epuo ninche aabatata to lalem, o to lameyu eidaikieki ninche; ebaiki oloti ometabaiki olkitok, keye nincheto lalem o to lameyu; naa keaku ninche enking'asia o enkuretisho o ldeket o enkurruna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaitame nanu lelo oobikito tiatua enkop e Misiri anaa enaidipa aitamio Yerusalem, to lalem to lameyu o to lmeitai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "keaku meetae hoo obo teilo pisiai le Yuda apa oewuo aton tiatua enkop e Misiri, ojeu aashu epok aashu eshuko alo enkop e Yuda, naa ninye apa etang'uarra pee eshuko aapuo aabik teine, amu merrinyo ninche meteleku ake ilkuti aisikak.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa lelo lewa pooki ooyiolo aajo eishoo nkituaak enye enkorropil kulie aitin, o nkituaak pooki naaitasheto te mbata, o lturrur kitok, ore iltung'ana pooki oomanya Patros tiatua enkop e Misiri, newaliki Yeremia ejo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore tialo ele rorei litolikio iyiook te nkarna o Laitoriani, mikining iyiook iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eikiaas iyiook pooki toki naba anaa enikinosakita olmumai, aapejoki enkorropil enkaiguanani e shumata nikibukoki ninye ilasarri ooki, anaa apa enikitaasa iyiook o loo papa, o laiguanak lang o lkituaak lang, tiatua inkanas e Yuda o too nkoitoi naalala e Yerusalem; amu ore apa ina kata nikiata endaa sapuk nikidupoyu, neitu kidol entorroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore anaa nikipal iyiook eitu kipejoki enkorropil enkainguanani e shumata o embukokinoto o lasar ooki, nikitalaita iyiook pooki toki neidaikieki iyiook to lalem o to lameyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo nkituaak, “Amaa apa pee kipejoki enkorropil enkaiguanani e shumata nikibukoki ninye olasar ooki, aimeyiolo apa ilmoruak lang pee kintayu imukateni naata enkitanyaanyukoto enye nikibukokininye ilasarri ooki?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yeremia ajoki iltung'ana pooki, ilewa o nkituaak, o lelo tung'ana pooki ooishoo ninye ena walata: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amaa tialo ina orropil apa nitapejo intae tiatua inkanas e Yuda, o too nkoitoi e Yerusalem, intae o loo papaai linyi, o laiguanak linyi olkituaak linyi, oltung'ana lena kop, keitu edamu Olaitoriani? Keitu elotu ena damunoto enye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meekure eidim Olaitoriani ating'iriakinoyu entorroni oo nkiaasin inyi o nena o lminong nitaasa intae, neaku etaa enkop inyi olmuaate ewueji mitil oldeket meetae olomanya, anaa enatiu ena olong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkaraki nitapejo intae enkorropil o enkaraki nitaasa intae eng'oki to Laitoriani aashu ipuopuo te nkitanapata enye o too nkiguanat enyena o te nchakenisho enye, pee etadoikio intae ena torroni, anaa enatiu ena olong.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Yeremia iltung'ana pooki o nkituaak pooki, “Entoning ororei lo Laitoriani, intae pooki le Yuda ootii atua enkop e Misiri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, Enkai e Israel: Ore intae o nkituaak inyi nimbalie too nkutukie inyi, nintabaitie too nkaik inyi, ijojo, ‘Esipa eikiaas iyiook nena nikinosakita olmumai likintobira aapejoki enkorropil enkaiguanani e shumata nikibukoki ninye olasar ooki.’ Entudup naa ilmuma linyi niasiasa nena! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa entoning ororei lo Laitoriani, intae pooki le Yuda oobikito tiatua enkop e Misiri: ng'ura, ainosa nanu olmumai te nkarna ai kitok, Olaitoriani ojo, nchere ore enkarna ai meitokini ae kata aaipot te nkutuk e pooki tung'ani le Yuda tiatua enkop pooki e Misiri, ejo, ‘Anaa enaishu Olaitoriani.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
