                "loc": "2CH.25.1+2CH.25.2+2CH.25.3+2CH.25.4+2CH.25.5+2CH.25.6+2CH.25.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 25.1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nji ejo Olaitoriani, ng'ura, kaishooyo nanu Farao, aisho Hofra ilo aiguanani le Misiri apik atua enkaina oo lmang'ati lenyena o atua enkaina e lelo ooing'oru enkishui enye, anaa apa enaishooyie Sedekia olaiguanani le Yuda apik atua enkaina e Nebukadnesa olaiguanani le Babilon olaa olmang'atinta lenye apa neing'oru enkishui enye.”",
          "type": "text",
